{"id":"st2073-7","designation":"ST 2073-7","title":"VC-5 Compression — VC-5 Video Essence Part 7. Metadata","state":"active","suite":"2073","official":{"family_url":"https://pub.smpte.org/doc/st2073-7/","latest_url":"https://pub.smpte.org/latest/st2073-7/","checked_at":"2026-11-18"},"scope":"This document extends the VC-5 standard to specify a method for representing metadata in VC-5 essence as the payload of VC-5 chunk elements. Metadata as defined in this standard can include intrinsic metadata that is specific to the VC-5 standard, extrinsic metadata that is defined in other standards, and dark metadata in a non-standard format. This standard defines a method for representing time series data in a VC-5 bitstream. Intrinsic metadata defined in this standard includes parameters that describe the image represented by VC5 essence, including the pixel format, color space, and co-siting of subsampled color difference components. This document specifies how to represent, in the VC-5 bitstream, extrinsic metadata in the following formats: XMP, DPX, SMPTE ST 377-1 MXF Annex F and G essence descriptors, ACES attributes, ALE, and dynamic metadata color volume transforms.","outline":[{"level":1,"title":"Foreword","page":5},{"level":1,"title":"1 Scope","page":6},{"level":1,"title":"2 Conformance Notation","page":6},{"level":1,"title":"3 Normative References","page":7},{"level":1,"title":"4 Terms and Definitions","page":9},{"level":2,"title":"4.1 aggregation","page":9},{"level":2,"title":"4.2 ALE","page":9},{"level":2,"title":"4.3 base64","page":9},{"level":2,"title":"4.4 big-endian","page":9},{"level":2,"title":"4.5 bitstream position","page":9},{"level":2,"title":"4.6 class","page":9},{"level":2,"title":"4.7 coordinate","page":9},{"level":2,"title":"4.8 count modulus","page":9},{"level":2,"title":"4.9 dark metadata","page":9},{"level":2,"title":"4.10 extrinsic metadata","page":9},{"level":2,"title":"4.11 fixed-point number","page":9},{"level":2,"title":"4.12 FourCC","page":9